 the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, and June to July in 27. In 2025, April to May hit 178% of normal on the middle, while November to December fell to 74%. Grid 21487 had its driest year in 1963 at 67% of normal.</p>"}
